Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,EAT THIS, PAL!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU'RE DEFENCELESS\NUNDER MY COUNTER ATTACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,YES, I WAS RIGHT, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,WHY IS SHE IN THIS DISCIPLINE, SELL?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,IT'S A DISK!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Palesnake is here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's who threw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You try to tell me that\NPalesnake is really...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're full of poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we find a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out. We're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the day I met Jolene on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still so clear it might\Nas well have been yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The weird scribbles on the public phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The fluffed up blankets on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The stink of the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards screaming and yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound of the doors\Nopening and closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing the toilets flushing all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I even remember all those silly\Ntalks with Jolene and everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,laughing hysterically.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I lived at\Nthe farm for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything\Nfrom before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can pull from that time are\Nrobotic thoughts, almost like recordings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply followed orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and my task was to protect Palesnake's\Ndisks without knowing or even asking why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand now that\Nliving is more than just being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Alive, it means making memories.\NIf I lose that, I lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene takes all these actions\Non behalf of her dad and risks
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,her life to help Aramis and\Nthe few other people she trusts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,because she has pleasant memories\Nfrom living her life that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the remarkable thing about\Nhumans their memories give their
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,souls, courage, the knowledge\Nthat I am FF. I never had that in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the past that's it I know it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that that is what intellect is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what's it going to be am I your\Nutmost priority or is it more
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,important to snuff out Dng's\Nlife to try and save Jolene's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you hesitated it's too late\Nthat moment will cost your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know why you have\Nyour intellect and powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I gave them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm taking them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When I need to kick up my courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think about Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Those very things are memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And this, this is intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:04:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth did FF just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She infused them with her own body fluids!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems FF pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They killed the user like\Nthey said they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing inside the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that thing was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what Pale Snake's\Nbeen after the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What purpose was it conceived to serve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And why does it need to\Nbe here specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Were the prisoners turned into plants,\Njust so this thing could finally be born?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's even weirder is, I stopped\Nbecoming a plant because it was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess it doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare let FF get away from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Retriever disc and read\Nevery memory on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate the warehouse of that thing born\Nfrom Dio's bone, and then go track it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not even last 30 seconds out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to get back to Jolene\Nand tell her who Pale Snake really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to know it's Father\NPoochy, the friggin' chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess you're thirsty and\Ntrying to go to the tap out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, before you hurry off, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,wait as I have quite an\Nimportant question to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, gotta go, but here's my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now about that question\NI wanted to ask you, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to get a good look
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,at the miracle that was just\Nborn in the discipline cells?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of organism was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it animal or plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And was it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me something, what's a\Npriest like you doing at this prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it isn't for anything noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush, I'm the one who's asking\Nthe questions, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, if I simply take\Nyour memories and read them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I would know the nature of\Nwhat was born immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,However I would much rather\Nhear your personal account of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it because saying things such\Nas it was soft or it was a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strange color or it was lovely\Nor your self-generated thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and not the memories actually\Nembedded within your disc I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,get it you're worried that\Nthing is gonna run away and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,disappear huh and you'd lose it\Nforever what are you saying it's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,already moved maybe who knows\Nto be honest you should be way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,more worried about it being\Nkilled much less moved actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the guy Jolene is\Nwith is kind of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'd kill it if he\Nthought it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing it is not only\Ndifficult, it's quite impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It possesses far too much power\Nand strength to fall prey to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My concern is that Jolene\Nwill get sidetracked
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,or do something rash and lose sight of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Jotaro's memories can\Ncontrol what has been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have those memories\Nin my clutches now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have finally come to the\Npoint where we're one step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What was its bodily form like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it develop quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it show response to stimuli?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if it hit the\Nwater, it would drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't quite remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay, well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's stalling for time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, FF's intellect. Its\Ncontrol tower is nowhere near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even better, I've got water now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I can go and\Ntell Jolene all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Intellect, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one who decides\Nwhere your intellect is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These powers belong to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's the one who graciously\Ngave you your stand powers with a disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You sent tin bag of plankton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're explaining things to me with\Nunearned triumph and arrogance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole body feels\Nlike it's burning away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this even water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is coming out of there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course it's\Nwater, but it's boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The highest temperature\Nall aquatic life on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,can withstand safely is about\N89.6 degrees Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have placed a different stand power that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,can boil water conveniently into this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can\Ndecide where your intellect is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Any water you touch\Nhenceforth is instantly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and reliably going to\Nboil with your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it fall in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it have drowned?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing has will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's running away,\Nthat must mean... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It might just be moving\Nby sentient instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's a plant or what\Nit is, But I have to stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if Pale Snake gets a\Nhold of it, then we're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Jolene, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, look down at the\Nrock that's right by your foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, don't take another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around and look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It just rolled a bit and became a\Nboulder. However, you Jolene your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, I said you\Ncan't get too close to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia look at you what happened to\Nyour height you're like so tiny now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia talk to me\Ntry to calm down Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how big is everything\Nlooking from your perspective?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The same as earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say, it looks like the only\None who shrank was you, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby looks completely\Nnormal-sized from where I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the rock that\Nturned over became small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not move from that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back to your own size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means that's what\Nthis baby's powers can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, when we\Nget too close to the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then boom, we shrink to a\Nfraction of our real size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those questions are quite hard to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if I get half this\Ndistance towards the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,my height accordingly gets cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then of course I have to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Twice as far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,if I get a quarter of the way to it, then\Nthe walk distance is multiplied by four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise, an eighth of the way\Nwill make it eight times farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One thirty-second, one sixty-fourth,\None one hundred twenty-eighth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If my body keeps getting smaller,\Nthen the distance keeps multiplying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The big question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,under these circumstances will we\Never be able to reach that baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think by its very\Ndesign, the answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way I'm going\Nto get my dad's memories back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's keeping the baby the\Nhell away from that asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.95,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll think about it after\Ngetting as far as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's ability to concentrate\Nor focus on one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably here because I was\Nattracted to that very quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Such focus makes her even more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:14:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,mark my words, I'm going to have those\Neyes look at me with that same intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No you can't Jolene pull\Nyour threat back now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you're never going to\Nreach that baby so you've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,got to let it go I refuse to accept that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,there has to be an end\Ncome on it's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,hey what if I jump from right\Nhere instead that could work
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,if I jump there's definitely\Nan end and that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,ground end of story watch\NI'm gonna land it Just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I beg you, do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground is so close, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about to touch it, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but could that\Nbe the green baby's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When am I going to hit the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, it's not just getting bigger,\Nbut it's getting stronger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's twice as big now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I think this stand came\Nout just so it could pull me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to not let me escape from\Nthis world that's falling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if this really is the baby's power,\Nthen I'll just have to catch the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that means I've caught the user!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dammit! I'm getting smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shrink down into nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The end wasn't the ground, it\Nwas the stand the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Drive
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so now we know the closer\Nyou keep getting to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the baby the smaller you\Nbecome and before long
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually you'll be nothing\Nalas it seems this baby
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,has an invincible stand we\Nstill don't know yet why
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it was born but it will\Nbe an enemy one day in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,fact this baby Jolene will\Nbe your direct enemy but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a second if it's\Ninvincible shouldn't that mean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,all the more reason I\Ncan't let palesnake have it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That baby threw the rock at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean it thinks\Nand knows how to reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it starting to recognize its\Npower and figuring out how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming! Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here\Nas fast as we can! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We could chase that baby forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it wouldn't matter because\Nwe won't be able to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:19:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least with this quick\Ndetour, we captured the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, haven't you seen it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand where you\Nand I just climbed toward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I took a risk, but that baby\Nhas intellect and curiosity, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It touched the bottle\NI threw at it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that anything it\Ntouches won't change size.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So this bottle is going to\Nstay exactly as it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't catch it by chasing\Nit, we'll force it to chase us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotten to the bottle, and\Nthe stand is now inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do is\Nmake sure it can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how the fuck\Nwe're supposed to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Diver Drive hiding in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically, inside its walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's altering the mouth for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge right in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've caught it. We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby's stand won't be\Nable to get out from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting around by rolling. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving the bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful or you'll destroy the bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse to get captured\Nby it when it escapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it somehow calculate that this was\Ngoing to happen and rolled the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, how is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to break that bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If it stays like this, you're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And why am I holding the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For real, what's going on? It seems this\Nthing is very interested in the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,shaped birthmark on your left shoulder\NI would even call it fixated something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,about it touching you has enabled us to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,return to our original size and if you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't noticed it has the same birthmark\Nin its shoulder too what is this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,apparently it's known Jolene since before\Nhey so uh I think this little goblin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,might be getting kind of attached to me\Num what should i do it's bonding not good
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:22:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no doubt in due time this\Nchild will become her enemy all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,i feel from this baby's powers is\Nmenace and infinite darkness we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,might need this thing to get back\Nyour dad's disc from pale snake and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,i know how important that is but\Nhonestly we may have to kill it now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,of some place other than he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You
